  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I want to know what VRChat is doing in regards to Optimisation. Because VRChat runs the worst out of ANY program on my computer.\n\ni7 3820 @ stock\n16gb ram\nGTX 1060 6GB\n25 mbit download/5 mbit upload\n\nWhile playing this game, it will go from 90 fps to 18 or even 1, causing the whole world to stutter and shake.\n\nConsidering my specs and internet connection, you guys really need to figure out a better loading system. If you can't make one then use an already pre built one.\n\nI know this game is free, but if you ever want me to put money into VRChat you have to put forward something that actually works.",
